    <p>The Product Design win cited three signature elements: the pleated 2.2L stainless steel mixing bowl, the 10-inch multi-touch display, and the matte-black architectural base. The UX win — the harder one to earn, since a jury has to test the actual workflow rather than just the look — cited the 100,000+ recipes synced seamlessly across the TM7, the Cookidoo app, and the web, plus the automatic weighing and guided step-by-step interface already covered on this site.</p>
